<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bradesco still a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bradesco still a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Caspian Securities said it was maintaining its buy rating on the preferred shares of Bradesco, Brazil's largest private bank, following the bank's release of a 824 million reais net profit in 1996.</p>
<p>-- It also said it sees a 19 percent upside potential for the stock by year-end.</p>
<p>-- Caspian also said Bradesco's 1996 net income was five percent higher than its estimates.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom, 5511 2485412))</p>
